WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:18.925
Bird and Kip went to the boardwalk.

2
00:00:18.926 --> 00:00:25.140
"Even the boardwalk is hot!" said Bird.

3
00:00:25.141 --> 00:00:29.093
"Let's look in the trash cans," said Kip.

4
00:00:29.094 --> 00:00:42.927
"Maybe we'll find cups with ice."

5
00:00:42.928 --> 00:00:49.354
Bird and Kip looked in the trash cans.

6
00:00:49.355 --> 00:01:09.293
They looked near the pizza place.

7
00:01:09.294 --> 00:01:18.667
They looked near the hot dog place.

8
00:01:18.668 --> 00:01:21.845
There was no ice.

9
00:01:21.846 --> 00:01:28.718
But Kip saw something else.

10
00:01:28.719 --> 00:01:42.866
"Ice cream!"

11
00:01:42.867 --> 00:01:46.417
"Forget it, Kip," said Bird.

12
00:01:46.418 --> 00:01:51.543
"The ice cream is just for people."

13
00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:54.646
Suddenly . . . Plop!

14
00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:57.952
The ice cream cone landed next to them.

15
00:01:57.953 --> 00:02:01.234
"My ice cream cone!" cried the boy.

16
00:02:01.235 --> 00:02:10.325
"I'll get you another one," said his mom.

17
00:02:10.326 --> 00:02:15.311
Kip stuck his face in the ice cream.

18
00:02:15.312 --> 00:02:21.832
"Brr!" he said.

19
00:02:21.833 --> 00:02:25.247
Bird stuck her face in the ice cream.

20
00:02:25.248 --> 00:02:29.295
"Brr!" she said.

21
00:02:29.296 --> 00:02:32.505
The friends laughed and laughed.

22
00:02:32.506 --> 00:02:36.854
At last they were cool.
